msgid "In another telling, it was at the cave that Asma’s waistband served them. She had brought their food but forgotten a strap to hang it by, so she split her waistband in two and hung the bag with one half."
msgstr "In another telling, it was at the cave that Asma’s waistband served them. She had brought their food but forgotten a strap to hang it by, so she split her waistband in two and hung the bag with one half."

