msgid "Even his mother’s kin, Banu ‘Adi ibn al-Najjar, called out, “Come to your mother’s people.” “Let her go her way,” he said. “She is under orders.” She walked on, and knelt among Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."
msgstr "Even his mother’s kin, Banu ‘Adi ibn al-Najjar, called out, “Come to your mother’s people.” “Let her go her way,” he said. “She is under orders.” She walked on, and knelt among Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."

