msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. “Let my camel go,” he said. “She knows where to stop.”"
msgstr "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. “Let my camel go,” he said. “She knows where to stop.”"

#: src/content/text.generated.js
msgid "He rode out of Quba on a Friday. On the way, the time for prayer came among Banu Salim ibn ‘Awf, and he prayed it in their mosque in the valley of Ranuna: his first Friday prayer in Madinah."
msgstr "He rode out of Quba on a Friday. On the way, the time for prayer came among Banu Salim ibn ‘Awf, and he prayed it in their mosque in the valley of Ranuna: his first Friday prayer in Madinah."

#: src/content/text.generated.js
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ stopped to lead the Friday prayer for the very first time there."
msgstr "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ stopped to lead the Friday prayer for the very first time there."

