msgid "One hot noon the Prophet ﷺ knocked at Abu Bakr’s door with big news: “Allah has given me permission to leave.”"
msgstr "One hot noon the Prophet ﷺ knocked at Abu Bakr’s door with big news: “Allah has given me permission to leave.”"

