msgid "When Abu Bakr slipped out with the Prophet ﷺ that night, by a small door at the back of his house, he carried all his money with him: five or six thousand dirhams."
msgstr "When Abu Bakr slipped out with the Prophet ﷺ that night, by a small door at the back of his house, he carried all his money with him: five or six thousand dirhams."

